================================================================================
COMMAND LINE USAGE EXAMPLES
================================================================================

1. Default: All components trainable:
   python train.py --method carot

2. Freeze entire text encoder (embeddings + transformers + projections):
   python train.py --method carot --freeze_text_encoder

3. Keep only last 2 transformer layers trainable (+ embeddings/projections):
   python train.py --method carot --trainable_layers 2

4. Freeze text encoder completely + keep only last 1 vision layer trainable:
   python train.py --method carot --freeze_text_encoder --trainable_layers 1

5. Freeze everything except logit_scale (extreme fine-tuning):
   python train.py --method carot --trainable_layers 0

6. Fine-tune only vision embeddings and projections (freeze all transformers):
   python train.py --method carot --freeze_text_encoder --trainable_layers 0

